Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact.

Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Reduce the equality to equality of the corresponding arguments. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses.

Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Rewrite the conclusion repeatedly using the stated equalities. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result.

